### Requisições de teste (extensão REST Client do VSCode: clique em "Send Request")
### Operadores: manutencao/manutencao (ROLE_MANUTENCAO) e admin/admin (ROLE_ADMIN)

### 1. Login válido -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "maria", "senha": "abc123" }

### 2. Login inválido (rodar 2x para bloquear o joao) -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "joao", "senha": "errada" }

### 3. Mesmo com a senha certa, joao bloqueado -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "joao", "senha": "123456" }

### 4. Desbloquear com manutencao -> 403 (não é admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/unlock/joao
Authorization: Basic manutencao manutencao

### 5. Desbloquear com admin -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/unlock/joao
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 6. Trocar senha -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/trocarsenha/pedro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "atual": "senha1", "nova": "nova1" }

### 7. Listar usuários (ROLE_MANUTENCAO) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao manutencao

### 8. Listar usuários com admin -> 403
GET http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 9. Cadastrar usuário (ROLE_MANUTENCAO) -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/
Authorization: Basic manutencao manutencao
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "carla", "senha": "c4rla" }

### 10. Métricas para o Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
